{"unit_id":"CARVIN94__dsh-router-ext-rtk#feature-1","repo":"CARVIN94/dsh-router-ext-rtk","commit":"d8479e12e3191f5010f857d0b0cf12ffcf8f66ad","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-router-ext-rtk 的功能「bash-rewrite」：bash 命令改写：RTK 启用且可用时，拦截器把 bash 的 command 交给 rtk rewrite；若返回不同的改写命令，就用该命令调用 bash 工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/intercept.ts:75-101","src/rtk.ts:103-129"]}
{"unit_id":"CARVIN94__dsh-router-ext-rtk#feature-2","repo":"CARVIN94/dsh-router-ext-rtk","commit":"d8479e12e3191f5010f857d0b0cf12ffcf8f66ad","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-router-ext-rtk 的功能「fallback」：原命令回退：未开启扩展、RTK 未就绪、没有等价改写或重写过程无法使用时，拦截器继续原始调用，其他工具也不受处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/intercept.ts:75-90","src/rtk.ts:103-129"]}
{"unit_id":"CARVIN94__dsh-router-ext-rtk#feature-3","repo":"CARVIN94/dsh-router-ext-rtk","commit":"d8479e12e3191f5010f857d0b0cf12ffcf8f66ad","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-router-ext-rtk 的功能「readiness」：RTK 就绪状态：插件注册扩展时探测本机 rtk，并向 dsh-router 暴露 ready 状态和不可用说明，供扩展管理界面判断是否可启用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/rtk.ts:170-173"]}
{"unit_id":"CARVIN94__dsh-router-ext-rtk#feature-4","repo":"CARVIN94/dsh-router-ext-rtk","commit":"d8479e12e3191f5010f857d0b0cf12ffcf8f66ad","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-router-ext-rtk 的功能「binary」：RTK 可执行文件定位：运行时优先使用 DSH_RTK_BIN 指定路径，再查 PATH 中的 rtk 和常见安装目录；环境变量可用于自定义二进制位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/rtk.ts:55-80","src/rtk.ts:111-118"]}
